      <p align="center"><font size="4" face="Verdana"><i><font color="#99FFFF" size="6">Visitor 
        Account Signup</font></i></font></p>
       
      <p><font face="Verdana" size="2">Welcome to the Spirit of Fire Online Guild 
        Hall! We're always happy to have visitors stop by. Whether you are a long 
        time friend of the guild, or if you've never really heard of us before, 
        you just may want to put your name on our Visitor Logbook. Why, you ask? 
        Well, doing so will open up some nice features you may want to use. For 
        instance:</font></p>
      <p><font face="Verdana" size="4" color="#99FFFF">&#149; </font><font face="Verdana" size="4"><i><font color="#FFFFCC">Visitors 
        have full access to the MessageNET</font></i></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br>
        That's right, you'll be able to use the famed Norrathian Ethereal Telegraph 
        System to send browser based messages to SoF Guild members and other visitors.</font></p>
      <p><font face="Verdana" size="4" color="#99FFFF">&#149; </font><font face="Verdana" size="4"><i><font color="#FFFF99">Visitors 
        have full access to the Chat Room</font></i></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br>
        Come on in and chat for a while!</font></p>
      <p><font face="Verdana" size="4" color="#99FFFF">&#149; </font><font face="Verdana" size="4"><i><font color="#FFFF66">Visitors 
        can be included in open scheduled raids.</font></i></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br>
        Heck, you can even schedule your own, and have us tag along!</font></p>
      <p><font face="Verdana" size="4" color="#99FFFF">&#149; </font><font face="Verdana" size="4"><i><font color="#FFFF00">Visitors 
        can get a visitor account with our Guild Bank</font></i></font><font face="Verdana" size="2"><br>
        Here you'll be able to purchase items and check out our inventory.</font></p>
      <hr noshade>
      <p><font face="Verdana" size="4"><font size="2"><b>General Information about 
        the Spirit of Fire:</b></font></font><b><font face="Verdana" size="2"> 
        <font size="1"></font></font></b><font face="Verdana" size="2"><font size="1"><br>
        The Spirit of Fire has been a constant feature on Zebuxorruk since it 
        was created. Previously, the guild resided on the Rathe server, then known 
        as the Spirits of Fyre. The guild currently has over 120 individual players, 
        and the average level of the guild is over 50. The guild is ruled by three 
        councils, the Initiation Council, who's task it is to oversee the indoctrination 
        of new members, the Council, which is actually made up of several &quot;sub-councils&quot;, 
        (like a Loot Council, Raid Council, and others) whose membership is comprised 
        of officers that enforce the laws of the guild, and the High Council, 
        comprised of the founders and other noteworthy officers who set policy 
        for the guild. The three councils are ruled by the Guildmaster, Sigurjon 
        Stormfyre.</font></font></p>
      <p align="center"><font face="Verdana" size="4"><i><font color="#CCCCFF">So, 
        would you like to sign up for a Visitor's Account? <br>
        </font></i><font color="#CCCCFF" size="2"><b><font color="#FFFFFF">We'll 
        need the following information:</font></b></font></font></p>
      <form action="visitor.asp" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="load" value="process">      
